From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:11:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] exp: add ADOT-OBI eBPF receiver (obi) to default OTel
 components

Registers github.com/aws-observability/adot-obi/receiver/obireceiver (type
"obi") in service/defaultcomponents and wires it through local replace
directives to ../adot-obi (patched OBI v0.12.2 + generated BPF bindings, and
the receiver module). Collector/contrib/otel versions unchanged. go mod tidy
adds 27 OBI-only modules; the only pre-existing go.mod versions that move are
github.com/BurntSushi/toml v1.4.0->v1.6.0 and github.com/mdlayher/socket
v0.4.1->v0.5.1, both forced by github.com/cilium/ebpf v0.22.0 (allowlisted in
adot-obi ci/cwagent-allowed-bumps.txt).

EXPERIMENTAL - local only.
---
 go.mod                                       | 44 +++++++++++++-
 go.sum                                       | 60 ++++++++++++++++++--
 service/defaultcomponents/components.go      |  2 +
 service/defaultcomponents/components_test.go |  1 +
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

